<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>冰岛详细行程</title>
  <meta name="description" content="10月24-30日冰岛详细路线：雷克雅未克、蓝湖、斯奈山半岛、维克、杰古沙龙、雷克雅内斯和凯夫拉维克。">
</head>
<body>
  <a class="skip-link" href="#main">跳到正文</a>
  <header class="site-header">
    <div class="nav">
      <a class="brand" href="index.html">冰岛 10月24-30日</a>
      <nav class="nav-links" aria-label="行程页面">
        <a href="/iceland/index.html">总览</a>
        <a href="/iceland/route-balanced.html" aria-current="page">详细行程</a>
        <a href="/iceland/locations.html">地点</a>
        <a href="/iceland/prep.html">准备</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main id="main">
    <section class="hero small" style="--hero-image: url('https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Kirkjufell_in_Iceland.jpg?width=960');">
      <div class="hero-content">
        <p class="eyebrow">主路线，按天气弹性调整</p>
        <h1>先走<ruby>斯奈山半岛<rt>Snæfellsnes</rt></ruby>，再去<ruby>维克<rt>Vík í Mýrdal</rt></ruby>、<ruby>杰古沙龙<rt>Jökulsárlón</rt></ruby>、<ruby>雷克雅未克<rt>Reykjavík</rt></ruby>和<ruby>凯夫拉维克<rt>Keflavík</rt></ruby>。</h1>
        <p>这版移除了<ruby>黄金圈<rt>Golden Circle</rt></ruby>和<ruby>赫本<rt>Höfn</rt></ruby>过夜。它保留最强景观，同时在最后的<ruby>雷克雅内斯<rt>Reykjanes</rt></ruby>/<ruby>凯夫拉维克<rt>Keflavík</rt></ruby>日前增加<ruby>雷克雅未克<rt>Reykjavík</rt></ruby>缓冲。</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="band">
      <div class="wrap">
        <h2>执行规则</h2>
        <div class="check-grid">
          <article class="info-card">
            <h3>每日出发/取消判断</h3>
            <p>出发前检查 Umferðin 道路状态、Vedur 天气预警、SafeTravel 警报和酒店取消条款。在进入<ruby>斯奈山半岛<rt>Snæfellsnes</rt></ruby>、<ruby>黑沙滩<rt>Reynisfjara</rt></ruby>、<ruby>杰古沙龙<rt>Jökulsárlón</rt></ruby>和<ruby>雷克雅内斯<rt>Reykjanes</rt></ruby>前再次确认。</p>
          </article>
          <article class="info-card">
            <h3>日照纪律</h3>
            <p>大多数游览应安排在约 09:00-17:30。必要时可以日出前转场，但不要在黑暗中走海滩、悬崖步道或陌生碎石支路。</p>
          </article>
          <article class="info-card">
            <h3>住宿目标</h3>
            <p>预订<ruby>雷克雅未克<rt>Reykjavík</rt></ruby>、<ruby>格伦达菲厄泽<rt>Grundarfjörður</rt></ruby>、<ruby>维克<rt>Vík í Mýrdal</rt></ruby>两晚、再次<ruby>雷克雅未克<rt>Reykjavík</rt></ruby>和<ruby>凯夫拉维克<rt>Keflavík</rt></ruby>/机场区。<ruby>格伦达菲厄泽<rt>Grundarfjörður</rt></ruby>和<ruby>维克<rt>Vík í Mýrdal</rt></ruby>优先选可取消房。</p>
          </article>
          <article class="info-card">
            <h3>现实检查</h3>
            <p>10月25日和10月27日仍是大日子。改进点在于你不再被迫到<ruby>赫本<rt>Höfn</rt></ruby>，也不用在西行前塞进<ruby>黄金圈<rt>Golden Circle</rt></ruby>。</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="band alt">
      <div class="wrap">
        <h2>逐日安排</h2>
        <p class="section-lead">时间是计划目标，不是预约时间。10月下旬先保护日照，其次才是餐厅。</p>
        <div class="timeline">
          <article class="day">
            <div class="day-date">
              <strong>10月24日 周六</strong>
              <span>抵达 + <ruby>雷克雅未克<rt>Reykjavík</rt></ruby></span>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3>KEF，<ruby>雷克雅未克<rt>Reykjavík</rt></ruby></h3>
              <p>第一天用于恢复体力，避免长距离景观车程，也避免航班延误影响带时间段的温泉预约。</p>
              <ul class="schedule-list">
                <li><strong>07:55-10:00：</strong>抵达 KEF，取行李，提车，买水和零食。</li>
                <li><strong>10:00-12:00：</strong>开到<ruby>雷克雅未克<rt>Reykjavík</rt></ruby>，停车，早餐，或先到酒店寄存行李，休息。</li>
                <li><strong>12:00-14:00：</strong>轻松逛港口、<ruby>哈帕音乐厅<rt>Harpa</rt></ruby>和<ruby>劳加维格<rt>Laugavegur</rt></ruby>主街。</li>
                <li><strong>14:00-17:15：</strong><ruby>哈尔格林姆教堂<rt>Hallgrímskirkja</rt></ruby>、太阳航海者、市中心；天气差就改去<ruby>珍珠楼<rt>Perlan</rt></ruby>。</li>
                <li><strong>18:00：</strong><ruby>雷克雅未克<rt>Reykjavík</rt></ruby>晚餐，早点睡。</li>
              </ul>
              <div class="meta"><span>驾驶：共 45-60 分钟</span><span>住宿：<ruby>雷克雅未克<rt>Reykjavík</rt></ruby></span><span>用餐目标：<ruby>雷克雅未克<rt>Reykjavík</rt></ruby>晚餐</span></div>
              <div class="stop-list">
                <a href="locations.html#hallgrimskirkja"><ruby>哈尔格林姆教堂<rt>Hallgrímskirkja</rt></ruby></a>
                <a href="locations.html#harpa"><ruby>哈帕音乐厅<rt>Harpa</rt></ruby></a>
              </div>
              <p><a class="button secondary" href="https://www.google.com/maps/dir/Keflavík+International+Airport/Reykjavík,+Iceland" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">打开 10月24日路线</a></p>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="day">
            <div class="day-date">
              <strong>10月25日 周日</strong>
              <span>完整<ruby>斯奈山半岛<rt>Snæfellsnes</rt></ruby></span>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3><ruby>雷克雅未克<rt>Reykjavík</rt></ruby>到<ruby>斯奈山半岛<rt>Snæfellsnes</rt></ruby>，住<ruby>格伦达菲厄泽<rt>Grundarfjörður</rt></ruby></h3>
              <p>这是明确投入给半岛的一天。早出发、压缩西端停留时间就可行；它不是慢节奏摄影日。</p>
              <ul class="schedule-list">
                <li><strong>07:30：</strong>带满油、补给和备用午餐，从<ruby>雷克雅未克<rt>Reykjavík</rt></ruby>出发。</li>
                <li><strong>09:00-09:30：</strong><ruby>博尔加内斯<rt>Borgarnes</rt></ruby>快速咖啡/加油。</li>
                <li><strong>10:15-11:00：</strong><ruby>伊特里通加<rt>Ytri Tunga</rt></ruby>海豹海滩或<ruby>格尔德贝格玄武岩柱<rt>Gerðuberg Cliffs</rt></ruby>；天气一般时二选一。</li>
                <li><strong>11:20-12:45：</strong><ruby>布迪尔<rt>Búðir</rt></ruby>和<ruby>阿尔纳斯塔皮<rt>Arnarstapi</rt></ruby>/<ruby>赫尔纳尔<rt>Hellnar</rt></ruby>海崖。</li>
                <li><strong>13:00-14:00：</strong>在<ruby>阿尔纳斯塔皮<rt>Arnarstapi</rt></ruby>附近午餐；餐厅少时使用备用午餐。</li>
                <li><strong>14:30-16:00：</strong><ruby>迪尤帕隆黑沙滩<rt>Djúpalónssandur</rt></ruby>和<ruby>斯奈山冰川国家公园<rt>Snæfellsjökull National Park</rt></ruby>观景点。</li>
                <li><strong>16:45-17:30：</strong>最后光线时看<ruby>教会山<rt>Kirkjufell</rt></ruby>/<ruby>教会山瀑布<rt>Kirkjufellsfoss</rt></ruby>。</li>
                <li><strong>17:45：</strong>到<ruby>格伦达菲厄泽<rt>Grundarfjörður</rt></ruby>，晚餐，住宿。</li>
              </ul>
              <div class="meta"><span>驾驶：4.5-5.5 小时 + 停留</span><span>住宿：<ruby>格伦达菲厄泽<rt>Grundarfjörður</rt></ruby></span><span>用餐目标：<ruby>阿尔纳斯塔皮<rt>Arnarstapi</rt></ruby>或备用午餐</span></div>
              <div class="stop-list">
                <a href="locations.html#borgarnes"><ruby>博尔加内斯<rt>Borgarnes</rt></ruby></a>
                <a href="locations.html#ytri-tunga"><ruby>伊特里通加<rt>Ytri Tunga</rt></ruby></a>
                <a href="locations.html#budir"><ruby>布迪尔<rt>Búðir</rt></ruby></a>
                <a href="locations.html#arnarstapi"><ruby>阿尔纳斯塔皮<rt>Arnarstapi</rt></ruby></a>
                <a href="locations.html#djupalonssandur"><ruby>迪尤帕隆黑沙滩<rt>Djúpalónssandur</rt></ruby></a>
                <a href="locations.html#kirkjufell"><ruby>教会山<rt>Kirkjufell</rt></ruby></a>
                <a href="locations.html#grundarfjordur"><ruby>格伦达菲厄泽<rt>Grundarfjörður</rt></ruby></a>
              </div>
              <p><a class="button secondary" href="https://www.google.com/maps/dir/Reykjavík,+Iceland/Borgarnes,+Iceland/Ytri+Tunga,+Iceland/Búðir,+Iceland/Arnarstapi,+Iceland/Djúpalónssandur,+Iceland/Kirkjufellsfoss,+Iceland/Grundarfjörður,+Iceland" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">打开 10月25日路线</a></p>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="day">
            <div class="day-date">
              <strong>10月26日 周一</strong>
              <span>转场到<ruby>维克<rt>Vík í Mýrdal</rt></ruby></span>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3><ruby>格伦达菲厄泽<rt>Grundarfjörður</rt></ruby>到<ruby>雷克雅未克<rt>Reykjavík</rt></ruby>午餐，再直奔<ruby>维克<rt>Vík í Mýrdal</rt></ruby></h3>
              <p>把这天当转场日。目标是以足够体力抵达<ruby>维克<rt>Vík í Mýrdal</rt></ruby>，为明天往返<ruby>杰古沙龙<rt>Jökulsárlón</rt></ruby>做准备。</p>
              <ul class="schedule-list">
                <li><strong>08:00：</strong>早餐后离开<ruby>格伦达菲厄泽<rt>Grundarfjörður</rt></ruby>。</li>
                <li><strong>10:00：</strong>风况轻松时，可在<ruby>博尔加内斯<rt>Borgarnes</rt></ruby>咖啡/加油。</li>
                <li><strong>12:00-13:30：</strong><ruby>雷克雅未克<rt>Reykjavík</rt></ruby>午餐、补给、检查道路和天气。</li>
                <li><strong>13:30-16:45：</strong>直接开到<ruby>维克<rt>Vík í Mýrdal</rt></ruby>；除非大幅提前，否则跳过南岸景点。</li>
                <li><strong>17:00：</strong>入住，晚餐，早点休息。</li>
              </ul>
              <div class="meta"><span>驾驶：5-6 小时 + 午餐</span><span>住宿：<ruby>维克<rt>Vík í Mýrdal</rt></ruby></span><span>用餐目标：<ruby>雷克雅未克<rt>Reykjavík</rt></ruby>午餐，<ruby>维克<rt>Vík í Mýrdal</rt></ruby>晚餐</span></div>
              <div class="stop-list">
                <a href="locations.html#grundarfjordur"><ruby>格伦达菲厄泽<rt>Grundarfjörður</rt></ruby></a>
                <a href="locations.html#borgarnes"><ruby>博尔加内斯<rt>Borgarnes</rt></ruby></a>
                <a href="locations.html#vik"><ruby>维克<rt>Vík í Mýrdal</rt></ruby></a>
              </div>
              <p><a class="button secondary" href="https://www.google.com/maps/dir/Grundarfjörður,+Iceland/Reykjavík,+Iceland/Vík+í+Mýrdal,+Iceland" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">打开 10月26日路线</a></p>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="day">
            <div class="day-date">
              <strong>10月27日 周二</strong>
              <span>冰河湖日</span>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3><ruby>维克<rt>Vík í Mýrdal</rt></ruby>到<ruby>杰古沙龙<rt>Jökulsárlón</rt></ruby>、<ruby>钻石沙滩<rt>Diamond Beach</rt></ruby>、<ruby>斯卡夫塔山<rt>Skaftafell</rt></ruby>，再回<ruby>维克<rt>Vík í Mýrdal</rt></ruby></h3>
              <p>这是修订路线中驾驶最重的一天。只有 1号公路畅通且你能日出前出发时才执行。不要加<ruby>赫本<rt>Höfn</rt></ruby>。</p>
              <ul class="schedule-list">
                <li><strong>07:00：</strong>满油、带食物，从<ruby>维克<rt>Vík í Mýrdal</rt></ruby>摸黑出发。</li>
                <li><strong>10:00-12:15：</strong><ruby>杰古沙龙<rt>Jökulsárlón</rt></ruby>和<ruby>钻石沙滩<rt>Diamond Beach</rt></ruby>，根据风和海浪调整顺序。</li>
                <li><strong>12:15-13:00：</strong>在冰河湖区或<ruby>弗雷斯内斯<rt>Freysnes</rt></ruby>/<ruby>斯卡夫塔山<rt>Skaftafell</rt></ruby>午餐；不要假设有很多开放餐厅。</li>
                <li><strong>13:15-15:15：</strong><ruby>斯卡夫塔山<rt>Skaftafell</rt></ruby>短步道；只有路况和时间都好时才尝试<ruby>斯瓦蒂瀑布<rt>Svartifoss</rt></ruby>。</li>
                <li><strong>15:30-18:00：</strong>开回<ruby>维克<rt>Vík í Mýrdal</rt></ruby>。除非特别提前，否则今天跳过<ruby>羽毛峡谷<rt>Fjaðrárgljúfur</rt></ruby>。</li>
                <li><strong>18:00：</strong><ruby>维克<rt>Vík í Mýrdal</rt></ruby>晚餐，住第二晚。</li>
              </ul>
              <div class="meta"><span>驾驶：5.5-6.5 小时 + 停留</span><span>住宿：<ruby>维克<rt>Vík í Mýrdal</rt></ruby></span><span>用餐目标：备用午餐或 <ruby>斯卡夫塔山<rt>Skaftafell</rt></ruby>/<ruby>弗雷斯内斯<rt>Freysnes</rt></ruby></span></div>
              <div class="stop-list">
                <a href="locations.html#vik"><ruby>维克<rt>Vík í Mýrdal</rt></ruby></a>
                <a href="locations.html#jokulsarlon"><ruby>杰古沙龙<rt>Jökulsárlón</rt></ruby></a>
                <a href="locations.html#diamond-beach"><ruby>钻石沙滩<rt>Diamond Beach</rt></ruby></a>
                <a href="locations.html#skaftafell"><ruby>斯卡夫塔山<rt>Skaftafell</rt></ruby></a>
              </div>
              <p><a class="button secondary" href="https://www.google.com/maps/dir/Vík+í+Mýrdal,+Iceland/Jökulsárlón+Glacier+Lagoon,+Iceland/Diamond+Beach,+Iceland/Skaftafell,+Iceland/Vík+í+Mýrdal,+Iceland" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">打开 10月27日路线</a></p>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="day">
            <div class="day-date">
              <strong>10月28日 周三</strong>
              <span>南岸西行</span>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3><ruby>维克<rt>Vík í Mýrdal</rt></ruby>西侧南岸景点，然后回<ruby>雷克雅未克<rt>Reykjavík</rt></ruby></h3>
              <p>这就是在<ruby>维克<rt>Vík í Mýrdal</rt></ruby>住两晚的回报：可以把南岸景点放在西行途中，而不是塞进冰河湖日。</p>
              <ul class="schedule-list">
                <li><strong>08:45-09:45：</strong>安全日光刚开始时去<ruby>黑沙滩<rt>Reynisfjara</rt></ruby>。严格遵守警示灯。</li>
                <li><strong>10:00-10:45：</strong>风力合理时去<ruby>迪霍拉里<rt>Dyrhólaey</rt></ruby>观景点。</li>
                <li><strong>11:15-12:30：</strong><ruby>斯科加瀑布<rt>Skógafoss</rt></ruby>；只有地面和时间都好时加<ruby>克维努瀑布<rt>Kvernufoss</rt></ruby>。</li>
                <li><strong>13:00-13:45：</strong><ruby>塞里雅兰瀑布<rt>Seljalandsfoss</rt></ruby>短停；结冰时不要走瀑布后方步道。</li>
                <li><strong>14:15-15:15：</strong>在<ruby>赫沃尔斯沃德吕尔<rt>Hvolsvöllur</rt></ruby>或<ruby>塞尔福斯<rt>Selfoss</rt></ruby>午餐。</li>
                <li><strong>16:30-17:30：</strong>到<ruby>雷克雅未克<rt>Reykjavík</rt></ruby>，晚餐，住宿。</li>
              </ul>
              <div class="meta"><span>驾驶：3-4 小时 + 停留</span><span>住宿：<ruby>雷克雅未克<rt>Reykjavík</rt></ruby></span><span>用餐目标：<ruby>赫沃尔斯沃德吕尔<rt>Hvolsvöllur</rt></ruby>/<ruby>塞尔福斯<rt>Selfoss</rt></ruby>午餐</span></div>
              <div class="stop-list">
                <a href="locations.html#reynisfjara"><ruby>黑沙滩<rt>Reynisfjara</rt></ruby></a>
                <a href="locations.html#dyrholaey"><ruby>迪霍拉里<rt>Dyrhólaey</rt></ruby></a>
                <a href="locations.html#skogafoss"><ruby>斯科加瀑布<rt>Skógafoss</rt></ruby></a>
                <a href="locations.html#kvernufoss"><ruby>克维努瀑布<rt>Kvernufoss</rt></ruby></a>
                <a href="locations.html#seljalandsfoss"><ruby>塞里雅兰瀑布<rt>Seljalandsfoss</rt></ruby></a>
              </div>
              <p><a class="button secondary" href="https://www.google.com/maps/dir/Vík+í+Mýrdal,+Iceland/Reynisfjara,+Iceland/Dyrhólaey,+Iceland/Skógafoss,+Iceland/Kvernufoss,+Iceland/Seljalandsfoss,+Iceland/Selfoss,+Iceland/Reykjavík,+Iceland" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">打开 10月28日路线</a></p>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="day">
            <div class="day-date">
              <strong>10月29日 周四</strong>
              <span>首都区或<ruby>雷克雅内斯<rt>Reykjanes</rt></ruby></span>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3>选择<ruby>雷克雅未克<rt>Reykjavík</rt></ruby>/首都区或<ruby>雷克雅内斯<rt>Reykjanes</rt></ruby>，晚上到<ruby>凯夫拉维克<rt>Keflavík</rt></ruby></h3>
              <p>当天早上再决定。如果<ruby>雷克雅内斯<rt>Reykjanes</rt></ruby>通行、大风或气体条件存疑，就留在市区，早点去<ruby>凯夫拉维克<rt>Keflavík</rt></ruby>。</p>
              <ul class="schedule-list">
                <li><strong>首都版：</strong><ruby>珍珠楼<rt>Perlan</rt></ruby>、市区博物馆/咖啡，然后按预约去<ruby>蓝湖<rt>Blue Lagoon</rt></ruby>或<ruby>天空温泉<rt>Sky Lagoon</rt></ruby>，再去<ruby>凯夫拉维克<rt>Keflavík</rt></ruby>。</li>
                <li><strong><ruby>雷克雅内斯<rt>Reykjanes</rt></ruby>版：</strong><ruby>克莱瓦湖<rt>Kleifarvatn</rt></ruby>、<ruby>塞尔屯<rt>Seltún</rt></ruby>，官方开放时才去<ruby>法格拉达尔火山<rt>Fagradalsfjall</rt></ruby>/<ruby>孙德努卡吉加火山口<rt>Sundhnúksgígar</rt></ruby>观景点，已预订则去<ruby>蓝湖<rt>Blue Lagoon</rt></ruby>，再到<ruby>贡努克维尔<rt>Gunnuhver</rt></ruby>、<ruby>大陆桥<rt>Bridge Between Continents</rt></ruby>和<ruby>凯夫拉维克<rt>Keflavík</rt></ruby>。</li>
                <li><strong>午餐：</strong>首都版在<ruby>雷克雅未克<rt>Reykjavík</rt></ruby>；只有官方通行和道路状态允许时，才考虑<ruby>格林达维克<rt>Grindavík</rt></ruby>/<ruby>雷克雅内斯拜尔<rt>Reykjanesbær</rt></ruby>。</li>
                <li><strong>17:00-18:30：</strong>入住<ruby>凯夫拉维克<rt>Keflavík</rt></ruby>或机场区。</li>
                <li><strong>晚上：</strong>如果按原计划夜间还车，先加油并归还车辆。确认酒店到 KEF 的交通。</li>
              </ul>
              <div class="meta"><span>驾驶：按选择约 1-4 小时</span><span>住宿：<ruby>凯夫拉维克<rt>Keflavík</rt></ruby></span><span>用餐目标：<ruby>雷克雅未克<rt>Reykjavík</rt></ruby>或<ruby>雷克雅内斯拜尔<rt>Reykjanesbær</rt></ruby></span></div>
